{"4846230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rooster Booster 3D", "steam_appid": 4846230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the charm of Rooster Booster - now in glorious 3D! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooster Booster 3D is a speed-oriented platformer inspired by retro titles that are snappy, simple, and most importantly, fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, bounce, and boost your way through tight turns and over death-defying jumps! Master the game's 3 playable courses by precisely timing each boost and discovering shortcuts along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of RB3D's courses showcase a different vaporwave-style aesthetic, complimented by groovy original music! As a reward for fast completion times, players can also unlock new playable critters in addition to the Golden Torus (and if the rumors are true, gold versions of each critter).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the charm of Rooster Booster - now in glorious 3D! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooster Booster 3D is a speed-oriented platformer inspired by retro titles that are snappy, simple, and most importantly, fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, bounce, and boost your way through tight turns and over death-defying jumps! Master the game's 3 playable courses by precisely timing each boost and discovering shortcuts along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of RB3D's courses showcase a different vaporwave-style aesthetic, complimented by groovy original music! As a reward for fast completion times, players can also unlock new playable critters in addition to the Golden Torus (and if the rumors are true, gold versions of each critter).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Rooster Booster 3D is a speedy retro platformer! Play through three unique, vaporwave-inspired zones as you optimize your completion time to unlock new characters and earn the Golden Torus!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4846230/574fb811975848a13007ef13471282eb902efb6e/header.jpg?t=1786402877", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4846230/ee98d9f871621f887f1a876c020c12a2e0acfbc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786402877", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4846230/ee98d9f871621f887f1a876c020c12a2e0acfbc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786402877", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Sequoia<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u